{"items":[{"id":"382350361","root":"382349151","user":{"id":"951466","name":"黄金罗盘","avatar":"a8f99903da610ca1bd783fad"},"text":"我其实也就是事发前两个星期才感觉不对的，是因为觉得不同投稿之间水平有差距，而且嗓音特色也不同，不过我没想到盗版，而是觉得直播不唱投稿唱，估计是live水平其实很一般，全靠后期剪辑修音才[emot=acfun,1796/]","time":1611913768811,"floor":1,"likes":1,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"382352300","root":"382349151","user":{"id":"7426207","name":"安倍㊙️晋三","avatar":"f4439e10997e8aa044aee601"},"text":"应该很多人都觉得不对，但没想到是这种不对[emot=acfun,1680/]","time":1611914320751,"floor":1,"likes":2,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"382352384","root":"382349151","user":{"id":"85701","name":"家里蹲的猫","avatar":"307d6b9a05b4e544d0c3ef7a"},"text":"[emot=acfun,1684/]说实话，当时的气氛唯一觉得不对劲的就是，她从年底到事情爆发前，都太勤劳了，不管是贴贴，联动，仿佛一个吹得很大的水泡，然后就被戳破了","time":1611914361647,"floor":1,"likes":4,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"382353412","root":"382349151","user":{"id":"386099","name":"超哥介猪怎么卖","avatar":"aa9230de4dd4f6bb8c86ba56"},"text":"我也觉得好奇怪，但是说不上来，只记得她直播时候说过想和别人贴贴，然后过了几天就开始和别人有联动了，从那之后就和越来越多人联动","time":1611914824950,"floor":1,"likes":1,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"家里蹲的猫","replyToUserId":"85701","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"382364394","root":"382349151","user":{"id":"1075891","name":"银河R","avatar":"4d0964c903c62f8aecb5c566"},"text":"事后回想才有不对，事先谁能想到的","time":1611917481828,"floor":1,"likes":2,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"382365730","root":"382349151","user":{"id":"12752614","name":"今天相亲了","avatar":"d135e00bcaabf6b23db714a0"},"text":"[emot=acfun,1686/]主要是说开歌回但是一拖再再拖 后面我忙了没看 也都不知道到底开过没 也没问","time":1611917908266,"floor":1,"likes":1,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"382368829","root":"382349151","user":{"id":"1295722","name":"独XL","avatar":"9d8c5a8e55605cc465a10290"},"text":"[emot=acfun,1686/]不知道有没记错，她直播唱过粤语歌，那粤语太纯正以至于我以为放的原唱。","time":1611918337259,"floor":1,"likes":1,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"382370462","root":"382349151","user":{"id":"22199062","name":"一片淡雪❄️","avatar":"764ec63f68affc16f7eb0aeb"},"text":"我也觉得就她“唱歌”演绎的太不可思议了，简直完美，不像人能办到的事儿，但是我又没看到其他人站出来质疑，自己也是个外行，就没有多去想……","time":1611918591584,"floor":1,"likes":2,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"382373533","root":"382349151","user":{"id":"1080233","name":"AC爆头娘™","avatar":"e89e88841c891e14a3905f53"},"text":"难道直播也是原音[emot=acfun,1686/]","time":1611919402668,"floor":1,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"独XL","replyToUserId":"1295722","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"382374345","root":"382349151","user":{"id":"194329","name":"夏维安3rdeye","avatar":"ff74cc81a78f36c74fbf91af"},"text":"说实话，我前两天还想这个问题呢，她直播的时候没唱过歌吧，水姐那是真的，像一个唱歌这么好的直播不唱，就感觉很奇怪了，没想到真的出事了","time":1611919532669,"floor":1,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"382385283","root":"382349151","user":{"id":"429450","name":"rock22333","avatar":"53ffdc9ca48c90e948cfafbb"},"text":"唉，说啥也是事后诸葛亮了","time":1611922619222,"floor":1,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"382401067","root":"382349151","user":{"id":"1601010","name":"来打我啊笨蛋","avatar":"1f04b7a47469a2e2807c4d10"},"text":"[emot=acfun,1782/]那是因为她直接把别人斗鱼杨一歌直播唱的盗来了\n连囚鸟的开头两个字抢拍都一模一样","time":1611926811875,"floor":1,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"独XL","replyToUserId":"1295722","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"382615234","root":"382349151","user":{"id":"7908763","name":"戴帽子的亚马孙","avatar":"0b4cff9fe4d6a58a4e936b73"},"text":"是的啊，没想到吧，直接放人家直播录音，网易搜索杨一歌","time":1611976487616,"floor":1,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"AC爆头娘™","replyToUserId":"1080233","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false}],"media":{"0b4cff9fe4d6a58a4e936b73":{"src":"https://tx-free-imgs.acfun.cn/style/image/201907/cU11F9VFDPNEk4Emx8KPPRa8nGjlQkPJ.jpg?imageslim","fallbacks":["https://tx-free-imgs.acfun.cn/vwAAVVnszh-bAv2Qv-ia6V3q-eiaINf-iM3mQj.png?imageslim","https://imgs.aixifan.com/style/image/201907/cU11F9VFDPNEk4Emx8KPPRa8nGjlQkPJ.jpg"]},"1f04b7a47469a2e2807c4d10":{"src":"https://tx-free-imgs.acfun.cn/FsCAJcehPGe8e1oIL22G6J29GZn4?imageslim","fallbacks":["https://tx-free-imgs.acfun.cn/cms/2020_01_21/1579588108492.png?imageslim","https://imgs.aixifan.com/FsCAJcehPGe8e1oIL22G6J29GZn4"]},"307d6b9a05b4e544d0c3ef7a":{"src":"https://tx-free-imgs.acfun.cn/content/2019_11_4/1.5728645567491343E9.png?imageslim","fallbacks":["https://tx-free-imgs.acfun.cn/F1Hjb5ckre-R77FRj-uqAVne-zMnAJn-niU7R3.png?imageslim","https://imgs.aixifan.com/content/2019_11_4/1.5728645567491343E9.png"]},"4d0964c903c62f8aecb5c566":{"src":"https://tx-free-imgs2.acfun.cn/bs2/acfun-image/499083_f0cf84e7f66549c0b373d65bcf135a5b.gif","fallbacks":["https://tx-free-imgs.acfun.cn/mfKg9o9tYm-bMnMRb-7ZRb2a-MFriAv-2Ezqyi.gif?imageslim","https://imgs.aixifan.com/newUpload/499083_f0cf84e7f66549c0b373d65bcf135a5b.gif"]},"53ffdc9ca48c90e948cfafbb":{"src":"https://tx-free-imgs.acfun.cn/style/image/201907/ScjqkjClZvakffxKYsZXlP2GpaU3nw64.jpg?imageslim","fallbacks":["https://tx-free-imgs.acfun.cn/kgBgxYiTb8-faYFNv-Nr2iAr-nqEvEv-AruUZ3.gif?imageslim","https://imgs.aixifan.com/style/image/201907/ScjqkjClZvakffxKYsZXlP2GpaU3nw64.jpg"]},"764ec63f68affc16f7eb0aeb":{"src":"https://tx-free-imgs2.acfun.cn/bs2/acfun-image/22199062_0246e692471e4a71b795365415c33cfe.jpg","fallbacks":["https://tx-free-imgs.acfun.cn/HGxVLInCIR-Q